# The Puppet Master (windurst 81): reply kinds at the House of the Hero (_6n2, Windurst Walls), against I Can Hear a
# Rainbow's 385 (Event, oncePerZone; accepted at Prog 0 by GM). The door's script answers nothing here (The Puppet Master
# not completed). Available (SMN, level 40): 402 (Progress) beats 385, begun; made available again by GM: 402 again (an
# Event 402 would tie with 385 and the cycle would play 385 now). Accepted: 403 and 385 are both Event lines: they cycle
# (403 first: The Puppet Master's container is the earlier), then 385 is spent for this zone visit (oncePerZone): 403 alone.
lists WindurstWalls/_6n2/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/402
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-24.5,-14.498,262.994 job=SMN lvl=40
quest Windurst.ICanHearARainbow accepted
login
trigger _6n2                                   # 402 (Progress) over 385 (Event)
finish                                         # begun
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster available       # GM
trigger _6n2                                   # 402 again
finish                                         # begun
trigger _6n2                                   # accepted: 403 (both Event: the earlier container's first)
finish
trigger _6n2                                   # 385 (the cycle)
finish
trigger _6n2                                   # 385 spent (oncePerZone): 403
finish
